{"seq":3,"slug":"marine-biotechnology","title":"海洋生物技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-biotechnology","wordCount":1964,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"海洋生物技术\">海洋生物技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"海洋药物发现与开发\">海洋药物发现与开发</h3><p>海洋生物产生结构独特的次生代谢产物，是新药发现的重要来源。截至 2025 年，已有超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 种海洋天然产物被鉴定，其中约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 种已获批上市或进入III期临床试验。海洋药物的结构多样性源于海洋生物独特的进化压力：高盐、高压、低温和光照匮乏环境驱动了新颖化学骨架的产生。</p>\n<p>抗肿瘤海洋药物是最成功的领域。Cytarabine（阿糖胞苷）源自加勒比海绵 <em>Tectitethya crypta</em> 的核苷类似物，是白血病标准化疗药物。Eribulin（甲磺酸艾日布林）是海绵天然产物 halichondrin B 的简化合成类似物，用于转移性乳腺癌治疗，年销售额超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 亿美元。Trabectedin（曲贝替定）来源于海鞘 <em>Ecteinascidia turbinata</em>，通过共价结合 DNA 小沟发挥抗癌作用。</p>\n<p>抗菌活性方面，深海放线菌（<em>Salinispora</em> 属）产生的 salinosporamide A 是 20S 蛋白酶体抑制剂，正在进行胶质母细胞瘤的临床试验。海洋真菌来源的 cephalosporin C 开创了头孢菌素类抗生素家族，至今仍是临床一线用药。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Drug</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Drug</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IC_{50} = \\frac{[\\text{Drug}]}{1 + \\left(\\frac{[\\text{Drug}]}{K_i}\\right)^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1713em;vertical-align:-1.7443em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2043em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Drug</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4343em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2043em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8813em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2043em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Drug</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"海洋基因组学与环境-dna-技术\">海洋基因组学与环境 DNA 技术</h3><p>海洋宏基因组学（marine metagenomics）通过直接测序环境样品中的全部 DNA，揭示了海洋微生物多样性的惊人规模。全球海洋病毒组（Global Ocean Virome）项目鉴定了超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 个病毒种群，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 为新发现物种。Tara Oceans 航次收集的宏基因组数据包含超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个基因家族，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 功能未知。</p>\n<p>环境 DNA（eDNA）技术通过检测水体中游离的生物 DNA 片段实现非侵入性物种监测。eDNA 的半衰期在海水中约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> 小时（取决于温度、UV 和微生物活性），因此反映的是近期生物存在信息。定量 PCR（qPCR）和宏条形码（metabarcoding）分别实现了目标物种定量检测和群落组成分析。</p>\n<p>第三代测序技术（Oxford Nanopore/PacBio HiFi）实现了海洋微生物完整基因组的单分子组装，解决了短读长无法区分高度相似菌株的问题。长读长 eDNA 方法正在开发中，有望提供物种级甚至种群级分辨率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"水产养殖技术前沿\">水产养殖技术前沿</h3><p>全球水产养殖产量于 2022 年首次超过捕捞渔业（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.308</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.308</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.308</span></span></span></span></span> 亿吨 vs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.922</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.922</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.922</span></span></span></span></span> 亿吨），选择育种技术是产量提升的关键驱动力。基因组选择（Genomic Selection, GS）利用全基因组 SNP 标记预测个体育种值，在大西洋鲑抗病性状选择中将遗传增益提高了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>CRISPR-Cas9 基因编辑在水产育种中的应用包括：敲除生长抑素受体基因实现快速生长（虹鳟体重增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>）、编辑 <em>myostatin</em> 基因获得肌肉肥大表型（斑马鱼、鲤鱼）、以及通过 <em>dnd</em> 基因敲除实现可逆不育（生物防控外来种）。</p>\n<p>疾病管理方面，RNA 干扰（RNAi）疫苗通过口服双链 RNA 靶向病毒基因实现免疫保护。白斑综合症病毒（WSSV）的 dsRNA 疫苗在对虾中将存活率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span> 提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。循环水养殖系统（RAS）配合生物絮团技术（biofloc）实现了近零排放高密度养殖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;海洋生物资源&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;基因组测序与分析&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;功能基因挖掘&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;药物先导化合物&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;工业酶与生物催化&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;育种分子标记&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;临床前/临床试验&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;生物制造&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I[&quot;基因组选择育种&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&quot;上市药物&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"海洋生物资源\"] --&gt; B[\"基因组测序与分析\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"功能基因挖掘\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"药物先导化合物\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"工业酶与生物催化\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"育种分子标记\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"临床前/临床试验\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"生物制造\"]\n    F --&gt; I[\"基因组选择育种\"]\n    G --&gt; J[\"上市药物\"]</pre><h3 id=\"海洋生物材料\">海洋生物材料</h3><p>壳聚糖（chitosan）是甲壳动物外骨骼中几丁质的脱乙酰化产物，其阳离子特性赋予了抗菌、促凝血和黏膜黏附性。医用壳聚糖水凝胶用于创伤敷料，止血时间缩短至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟。壳聚糖纳米粒子作为药物递送载体，可实现 pH 响应性释放（在肿瘤微环境的低 pH 下释药）。</p>\n<p>海藻酸钠（alginate）提取自褐藻细胞壁，与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Ca</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ca}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ca</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 交联形成&quot;蛋盒模型&quot;（egg-box model）凝胶。海藻酸钙微球在细胞封装（胰岛移植）、组织工程支架和 3D 生物打印墨水中广泛应用。凝胶强度由 M/G 比值决定：高古罗糖醛酸（G-block）含量产生刚性凝胶。</p>\n<p>胶原蛋白从海洋鱼类皮肤和鳞片中提取，避免了陆源胶原的宗教和疾病传播问题。海洋胶原的变性温度较低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>—<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>），需通过交联改性提高热稳定性。珍珠层仿生材料（nacre-inspired composites）模拟贝壳的&quot;砖-泥&quot;微结构，实现了高强度与高韧性的统一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"蓝色生物经济\">蓝色生物经济</h3><p>蓝色生物经济（Blue Bioeconomy）将海洋生物资源的可持续利用与高附加值产品开发相结合。欧盟蓝色生物经济市场规模预计从 2020 年的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>€</mtext><mn>350</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">€350</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">€350</span></span></span></span></span> 亿增长至 2030 年的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>€€</mtext><mn>750</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">€€750</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">€€750</span></span></span></span></span> 亿。关键领域包括：微藻生物柴油（<em>Nannochloropsis</em> 油脂含量达干重的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>）、海藻生物塑料（替代石油基包装材料）和海洋益生菌（水产健康管理）。</p>\n<p>微藻固碳工厂利用光生物反应器培养微藻，同时固定工业 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 排放。每吨微藻干重可固定约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span></span></span></span></span> 吨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，产出高价值产品包括 EPA/DHA omega-3 脂肪酸（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 3: &gt; \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">&gt; \\</span></span>50,000/\\text{t}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>）、虾青素（</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">）、虾青素（</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）、虾青素（</span></span></span></span></span>&gt; $7,000/\\text{kg}$）和藻蓝蛋白（食品着色剂）。海洋来源的极端酶（嗜热/嗜冷/嗜盐酶）在洗涤剂、食品加工和分子生物学试剂中具有不可替代的工业价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026 年海洋生物技术的突破性进展包括：AI 辅助的海洋天然产物发现——深度学习模型（如 MolGPT）从海洋微生物基因组中预测新型次生代谢产物的生物合成基因簇（BGC），将候选药物筛选效率提高了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 倍以上。合成生物学实现了复杂海洋天然产物在工程微生物中的异源表达，解决了&quot;供应瓶颈&quot;问题。</p>\n<p>CRISPR 基因驱动（gene drive）在入侵性海洋物种管理中的伦理和生态风险引发激烈讨论。同时，表观遗传编辑（epigenetic editing）在水产养殖中展现潜力——通过修改 DNA 甲基化模式而非序列本身来改良性状，可能规避转基因法规限制。</p>\n<p>海洋碳汇增强技术（ocean CDR）中，海洋碱度增强（Ocean Alkalinity Enhancement, OAE）通过添加碱性矿物提升海水 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 吸收能力，首批开放海域试验于 2025 年在北海启动，单位成本目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 1: \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\</span></span>50<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>—</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">—</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">—</span></span></span></span></span>$150/\\text{t CO}_2$。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为何海洋天然产物相比陆地来源具有更高的化学结构新颖性？从进化生态学角度解释海洋化学防御的特殊性。</li>\n<li>比较基因组选择（GS）和传统家系选择在水产育种中的优缺点，特别考虑低遗传力性状（如抗病性）的改良效率。</li>\n<li>评估微藻生物柴油相对于陆生能源作物（如大豆、油棕）的优势与商业化瓶颈，提出技术路线图。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>海洋生物技术通过整合基因组学、合成生物学和材料科学，将海洋生物多样性转化为药物、材料、食品和能源等高附加值产品。从深海微生物的新型药物发现到 CRISPR 驱动的精准水产育种，海洋生物技术正在推动蓝色生物经济的快速增长，同时为应对气候变化和粮食安全提供创新解决方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"海洋生物技术","id":"海洋生物技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"海洋药物发现与开发","id":"海洋药物发现与开发"},{"level":3,"text":"海洋基因组学与环境 DNA 技术","id":"海洋基因组学与环境-dna-技术"},{"level":3,"text":"水产养殖技术前沿","id":"水产养殖技术前沿"},{"level":3,"text":"海洋生物材料","id":"海洋生物材料"},{"level":3,"text":"蓝色生物经济","id":"蓝色生物经济"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海洋生态系统生态学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-ecosystem-ecology"},"next":{"title":"海底地质学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/seafloor-geology"}}